{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o022c","title":"于禁乐进焚袁绍别屯何茂王摩等降","accounts":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o022c-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"于禁乐进焚袁绍别屯何茂王摩等降","evidence":["zhangle-e-o022c-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0162","role":"征讨","evidence":["zhangle-e-o022c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0236","role":"征讨","evidence":["zhangle-e-o022c-q"]},{"person":"zhangle-p0021","role":"降","evidence":["zhangle-e-o022c-q"]},{"person":"zhangle-p0022","role":"降","evidence":["zhangle-e-o022c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"征张绣至官渡战时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhangle-e-o022c-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o022c-q","source_order":[17,75,"O022c"],"order":3527}],"persons":[{"id":"zhangle-p0022","name":"王摩","evidence":["zhangle-q-o022"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhangle-m-o022-zhangle-p0022","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o022"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o022c-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-3c2b1d6da151e5fdfca1","layer":"original","quote":"复与乐进等将步骑五千，击绍别营：从延津西南，缘河至汲、获嘉二县〖9〗，焚烧堡聚三十余屯；斩首、获生各数千，降绍将何茂、王摩等二十余人。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":108,"end":175,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-o022","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-3c2b1d6da151e5fdfca1","layer":"original","quote":"复从攻张绣于穰，擒吕布于下邳；别与史涣、曹仁攻眭固于射犬，破斩之。太祖初征袁绍，绍兵盛，禁愿为先登。太祖壮之，乃遣步卒二千人，使禁将，守延津以拒绍；太祖引军还官渡。刘备以徐州叛，太祖东征之。绍攻禁，禁坚守，绍不能拔。复与乐进等将步骑五千，击绍别营：从延津西南，缘河至汲、获嘉二县〖9〗，焚烧堡聚三十余屯；斩首、获生各数千，降绍将何茂、王摩等二十余人。太祖复使禁别将屯原武，击绍别营于杜氏津〖10〗，破之。迁裨将军。后从还官渡。太祖与绍连营，起土山相对。绍射营中，士卒多死伤，军中惧。禁督守土山，力战，气益奋。绍破，迁偏将军。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":262,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
